Subject: [PATCH] Classifier for the reconstruction types (to/classify.py) and
 its regression

Types 1-11 (lattices out of scope; hybrid is 11). Every test is computed and
reported: axisymmetry (IoU with the revolved image), slab ratio, column tests
(extrude, stepped / height field on a sheet, sandwich by the largest two-layer
area), then medial-axis segments with curvature as a sagitta in radii and joints
and fragments folded into their members. Exact test models: shell made
ellipsoidal (a spherical cap is axisymmetric), lattice dropped.
run_classify.py: 11 models x 8 variants (rotations, units, resolution) all pass.

